    { math: '2 · Source cultivation and protection', note: 'Whistleblowers risk careers: the reporter\'s duty is secure channels (encrypted comms — the cryptography lesson; operational security against legal compulsion), patience (months of trust-building), and never burning a source (the profession\'s capital crime).' },
