    { math: '4 · Impact and aftermath', note: 'The best investigations end careers, laws or presidencies (Spotlight, 2002 — the Boston Globe\'s church investigation, 2015\'s film; Snowden, 2013 — the ethics debate the law lesson never resolved). Impact carries duty: follow-up reporting, protecting sources afterward, and honest accounting when the story misses.' },
